  "notes": "USAGE:\nCommonly used in health articles, product marketing (pillows, mattresses), and wellness discussions. Often appears in compound phrases related to sleep improvement.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {快眠|かいみん}グッズ (sleep aids, sleep products)\n- {快眠|かいみん}のコツ (tips for good sleep)\n- {快眠|かいみん}{法|ほう} (methods for sound sleep)\n- {快眠|かいみん}まくら (comfort pillow)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {安眠|あんみん}: peaceful sleep — similar but often used with {妨害|ぼうがい} (disturbance)\n- {熟睡|じゅくすい}: deep sleep — emphasizes sleeping deeply rather than comfortably",
